        "North Kivu remains over treatment capacity at 181/141 = 128.4%; five Ituri structures are at or above confirmed-case capacity.",
        "Alert investigation is 87.2% nationally, with Haut-Uele ND and Tshopo at 25.0% on stale 30 July data.",
        "At least one unresolved Ituri resistance event, two Mandima burial refusals, and persistent resistance in five Ituri zones affect operational functions.",
